<!-- ══════════════ 02 · ABOUT ══════════════ -->
<section class="sec" id="about">
  <div class="wrap ab">
    <div class="ab-l rv">
      <p class="tag"><i>02</i> Who we are</p>
      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:20px">One city.<br>One <em>shared</em><br>responsibility.</h2>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 300 150" style="margin-top:36px;max-width:300px" aria-hidden="true">
        <g fill="none" stroke="#0E2233" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round">
          <path d="M10 120h280" opacity=".3"/>
          <path d="M40 120V70h50v50M90 120V50h50v70M140 120V80h50v40M190 120V60h60v60" fill="#0F6E68" fill-opacity=".18"/>
          <path d="M55 92h8M105 78h8M158 98h8M212 84h8" stroke="#E8912A" stroke-width="5"/>
          <circle cx="248" cy="34" r="15" fill="#E8912A" fill-opacity=".45" stroke="none"/>
        </g>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="ab-b rv">
      <p class="first">Jalna's progress cannot rest on one person, one organisation or one department.</p>
      <p>Jalna First Citizen Forum is a citizen-led platform for Jalna's development. It brings residents, entrepreneurs, businesses, institutions, experts and public authorities into a constructive civic conversation.</p>
      <p>We are not a municipal department and do not replace official civic channels. We share verified information, encourage participation and help connect stakeholders around Jalna's development priorities. At the centre of it is collective ownership — everyone who calls Jalna home has a part in shaping it.</p>
      <div class="chips">
        <span class="chip"><i style="background:var(--teal)"></i>Citizens</span>
        <span class="chip"><i style="background:var(--marigold)"></i>Government &amp; administration</span>
        <span class="chip"><i style="background:var(--leaf)"></i>Businesses &amp; entrepreneurs</span>
        <span class="chip"><i style="background:var(--teal)"></i>Schools &amp; institutions</span>
        <span class="chip"><i style="background:var(--marigold)"></i>Experts</span>
        <span class="chip"><i style="background:var(--leaf)"></i>Community organisations</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

